        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-5$ or $x=4$",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $4x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x(x+1)&=20\\\\x^2+x-20&=0\\\\(x+5)(x-4)&=0\\\\x+5&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-4=0\\\\x&=-5\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=4\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values satisfy the original equation.",
