        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-2$ or $x=7$",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-14&=5x\\\\x^2-5x-14&=0\\\\(x+2)(x-7)&=0\\\\x+2&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-7=0\\\\x&=-2\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=7\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values satisfy the original equation.",
