        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=1$ or $x=9$",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $5x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x(35-4x)&=36-5x\\\\35x-4x^2&=36-5x\\\\4x^2-40x+36&=0\\\\x^2-10x+9&=0\\\\(x-1)(x-9)&=0\\\\x-1&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-9=0\\\\x&=1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=9\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values satisfy the original equation.",
